      "content": "hey i'm working on a pitch deck for a mid-sized tech firm that wants to officially pivot their corporate strategy to be way more focused on ESG stuff. basically they want to move away from just focusing on quarterly profits and really bake social justice and environmental sustainability into their core mission. can u help me write a professional sounding justification for why this is the right move for their long-term success?",
